mission "The Boom at Cormorant Quay"
    name "The Boom at Cormorant Quay"
    description "Break the four gunboats at the Western Boom and return to Cormorant Quay for the shipwright's report."
    source "Puerto Cielo"
    destination "Cormorant Quay"
    reward 760
    objective kills 4
    battlefield "The Western Boom" 10500 6000
    enemy "The Western Boom Guard 1"
    enemy "The Western Boom Guard 2"
    enemy "The Western Boom Guard 3"
    enemy "The Western Boom Guard 4"
    speaker offer "Captain Ines Calderon"
    speaker visit "Captain Ines Calderon"
    speaker complete "Captain Ines Calderon"
    to offer
        has "A House Above the Reefs: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `The Company has stretched a chain boom across the western channel and stationed four gunboats to guard it.`
            `If the boom is raised, the free captains can reach the river ports. If it remains closed, Ashcombe can starve the Leeward Expanse into obedience.`
            `The gunboats have been reinforced with swivel guns. Your escorts may help hold their attention, but the objective ships must all be sunk.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `The gunboats have been reinforced with swivel guns. Your escorts may help hold their attention, but the objective ships must all be sunk.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `Mateo gives you the tide table. “The chain is heaviest at the centre. Clear the guards and I will have the harbour crews raise it before dawn.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Boom at Cormorant Quay. Break the four gunboats at the Western Boom and return to Cormorant Quay for the shipwright's report."
    on visit
        conversation
            `The boom is lifted. A captured signal officer reveals that Ashcombe has moved his headquarters to Nueva Esperanza on the Spanish Main.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `The free captains now have a route into the Company's richest waters.`
        log "Completed The Boom at Cormorant Quay. Received 760 gold. The free captains now have a route into the Company's richest waters."
